[E-PARTIAL-CALLBACK] Error: `total` can't be passed to `applyAll` here
   ╭─[ reject/partial-map-fixed-row.sw:9:57 ]
   │
 9 │ def total (n: Nat): {Partial} Nat := List.sum (applyAll total [n])
   │                                                         ──┬──  
   │                                                           ╰──── `total` calls `total`, so as a value it makes requests that only `total`'s own definition can answer
